<section background-color="heading" id="bbs003" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Inverse-ground cover (heading color as the card fill, so dark on a light brand and light on a dark one): title fields on the left, one image region on the right for the brand's own graphic or photograph, reading as plain ground when empty.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item colspan="36" vertical-align="center" id="u6VVMXExrx"><p role="eyebrow">Company presentation</p><h1 font-size="44pt">A clear plan for the year ahead</h1><p font-size="lg">How Northwind Supply will grow revenue, hold margin, and build the team the plan needs.</p><spacer size="24pt"></spacer><p font-size="sm">Northwind Supply · Leadership offsite · March 2026</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="24" padding="0" id="nmSrz-kdn6"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" background="true" meta='{"width":1440,"height":2560}' /></grid-item></grid></section>